<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25575" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-πνοή</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>outlet, vent for the wind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mete.</u>
				368b9
			</span></i>: pl., <i>gap, interstice,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Erot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαρόλχας;</span>
			
			<i>pores,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CA</u>
				2.7
			</span></i>; <i>organs of respiration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>SA</u>
				1.5
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>exhalation,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				16.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>transpiration,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Alim.</u>
				28
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.Aphr.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				2.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				15.180
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>; of <i>vapours</i> or <i>humours,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>CA</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>CD</u>
				2.13
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>expulsion of flatus,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>SD</u>
				2.8
			</span></i>.</div>
